\">Lisburn</p></div><div><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"OMP_LISB\" name=\"cinema_item\" class=\"hidden\" /><img src=\"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_checkbox-off.svg\" class=\"checkbox-img w-7\" /></div></div><div class=\"site-selection-item my-2 flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between py-3\"><div><p class=\"text-xl text-white\">Newry</p></div><div><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"OMP_NEWR\" name=\"cinema_item\" class=\"hidden\" /><img src=\"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_checkbox-off.svg\" class=\"checkbox-img w-7\" /></div></div><div class=\"site-selection-item my-2 flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between py-3\"><div><p class=\"text-xl text-white\">Omagh</p></div><div><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"OMP_OMAG\" name=\"cinema_item\" class=\"hidden\" /><img src=\"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_checkbox-off.svg\" class=\"checkbox-img w-7\" /></div></div></div></div><div class=\"region-group mb-2\"><div class=\"region-header flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between py-3\"><p class=\"text-xl text-white\">Rep. of Ireland</p><i class=\"icon-swtich icon omni-chevron-up text-xl text-white\"></i></div><div class=\"region-items\"><div class=\"site-selection-item my-2 flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between py-3\"><div><p class=\"text-xl text-white\">Arklow</p></div><div><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"OMP_ARKL\" name=\"cinema_item\" class=\"hidden\" /><img src=\"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_checkbox-off.svg\" class=\"checkbox-img w-7\" /></div></div><div class=\"site-selection-item my-2 flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between py-3\"><div><p class=\"text-xl text-white\">Ballinasloe</p></div><div><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"OMP_BALL\" name=\"cinema_item\" class=\"hidden\" /><img src=\"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_checkbox-off.svg\" class=\"checkbox-img w-7\" /></div></div><div class=\"site-selection-item my-2 flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between py-3\"><div><p class=\"text-xl text-white\">Carlow</p></div><div><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"OMP_CARL\" name=\"cinema_item\" class=\"hidden\" /><img src=\"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_checkbox-off.svg\" class=\"checkbox-img w-7\" /></div></div><div class=\"site-selection-item my-2 flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between py-3\"><div><p class=\"text-xl text-white\">Cork</p></div><div><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"OMP_MAHO\" name=\"cinema_item\" class=\"hidden\" /><img src=\"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_checkbox-off.svg\" class=\"checkbox-img w-7\" /></div></div><div class=\"site-selection-item my-2 flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between py-3\"><div><p class=\"text-xl text-white\">Drogheda - Scotch Hall</p></div><div><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"OMP_SCOT\" name=\"cinema_item\" class=\"hidden\" /><img src=\"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_checkbox-off.svg\" class=\"checkbox-img w-7\" /></div></div><div class=\"site-selection-item my-2 flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between py-3\"><div><p class=\"text-xl text-white\">Dublin - Balbriggan</p></div><div><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"OMP_BALB\" name=\"cinema_item\" class=\"hidden\" /><img src=\"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_checkbox-off.svg\" class=\"checkbox-img w-7\" /></div></div><div class=\"site-selection-item my-2 flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between py-3\"><div><p class=\"text-xl text-white\">Dublin - Nutgrove</p></div><div><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"OMP_NUTG\" name=\"cinema_item\" class=\"hidden\" /><img src=\"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_checkbox-off.svg\" class=\"checkbox-img w-7\" /></div></div><div class=\"site-selection-item my-2 flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between py-3\"><div><p class=\"text-xl text-white\">Dublin - Rathmines</p></div><div><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"OMP_RATH\" name=\"cinema_item\" class=\"hidden\" /><img src=\"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_checkbox-off.svg\" class=\"checkbox-img w-7\" /></div></div><div class=\"site-selection-item my-2 flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between py-3\"><div><p class=\"text-xl text-white\">Dundalk</p></div><div><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"OMP_DUND\" name=\"cinema_item\" class=\"hidden\" /><img src=\"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_checkbox-off.svg\" class=\"checkbox-img w-7\" /></div></div><div class=\"site-selection-item my-2 flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between py-3\"><div><p class=\"text-xl text-white\">Galway - Salthill</p></div><div><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"OMP_GALW\" name=\"cinema_item\" class=\"hidden\" /><img src=\"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_checkbox-off.svg\" class=\"checkbox-img w-7\" /></div></div><div class=\"site-selection-item my-2 flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between py-3\"><div><p class=\"text-xl text-white\">Killarney</p></div><div><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"OMP_KILL\" name=\"cinema_item\" class=\"hidden\" /><img src=\"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_checkbox-off.svg\" class=\"checkbox-img w-7\" /></div></div><div class=\"site-selection-item my-2 flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between py-3\"><div><p class=\"text-xl text-white\">Limerick</p></div><div><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"OMP_LIME\" name=\"cinema_item\" class=\"hidden\" /><img src=\"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_checkbox-off.svg\" class=\"checkbox-img w-7\" /></div></div><div class=\"site-selection-item my-2 flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between py-3\"><div><p class=\"text-xl text-white\">Longford</p></div><div><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"OMP_LONG\" name=\"cinema_item\" class=\"hidden\" /><img src=\"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_checkbox-off.svg\" class=\"checkbox-img w-7\" /></div></div><div class=\"site-selection-item my-2 flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between py-3\"><div><p class=\"text-xl text-white\">Monaghan</p></div><div><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"OMP_MONA\" name=\"cinema_item\" class=\"hidden\" /><img src=\"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_checkbox-off.svg\" class=\"checkbox-img w-7\" /></div></div><div class=\"site-selection-item my-2 flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between py-3\"><div><p class=\"text-xl text-white\">Mullingar</p></div><div><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"OMP_MULL\" name=\"cinema_item\" class=\"hidden\" /><img src=\"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_checkbox-off.svg\" class=\"checkbox-img w-7\" /></div></div><div class=\"site-selection-item my-2 flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between py-3\"><div><p class=\"text-xl text-white\">Nenagh</p></div><div><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"OMP_NENA\" name=\"cinema_item\" class=\"hidden\" /><img src=\"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_checkbox-off.svg\" class=\"checkbox-img w-7\" /></div></div><div class=\"site-selection-item my-2 flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between py-3\"><div><p class=\"text-xl text-white\">Roscommon</p></div><div><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"OMP_ROSC\" name=\"cinema_item\" class=\"hidden\" /><img src=\"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_checkbox-off.svg\" class=\"checkbox-img w-7\" /></div></div><div class=\"site-selection-item my-2 flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between py-3\"><div><p class=\"text-xl text-white\">Shannon</p></div><div><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"OMP_SHAN\" name=\"cinema_item\" class=\"hidden\" /><img src=\"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_checkbox-off.svg\" class=\"checkbox-img w-7\" /></div></div><div class=\"site-selection-item my-2 flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between py-3\"><div><p class=\"text-xl text-white\">Sligo</p></div><div><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"OMP_SLIG\" name=\"cinema_item\" class=\"hidden\" /><img src=\"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_checkbox-off.svg\" class=\"checkbox-img w-7\" /></div></div><div class=\"site-selection-item my-2 flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between py-3\"><div><p class=\"text-xl text-white\">Tralee</p></div><div><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"OMP_TRAL\" name=\"cinema_item\" class=\"hidden\" /><img src=\"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_checkbox-off.svg\" class=\"checkbox-img w-7\" /></div></div><div class=\"site-selection-item my-2 flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between py-3\"><div><p class=\"text-xl text-white\">Waterford</p></div><div><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"OMP_WATE\" name=\"cinema_item\" class=\"hidden\" /><img src=\"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_checkbox-off.svg\" class=\"checkbox-img w-7\" /></div></div><div class=\"site-selection-item my-2 flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between py-3\"><div><p class=\"text-xl text-white\">Wexford</p></div><div><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"OMP_WEXF\" name=\"cinema_item\" class=\"hidden\" /><img src=\"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_checkbox-off.svg\" class=\"checkbox-img w-7\" /></div></div></div></div>\r\n          <input type=\"hidden\" class=\"action\" name=\"action\" value=\"process\" />\r\n        </form>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div id=\"footerControl\" class=\"hidden shrink-0 bg-[#282828]\">\r\n    <div class=\"main-container mx-auto w-full max-w-[560px] px-4 py-4\">\r\n      <button id=\"siteSelectButton\" type=\"button\" class=\"btn-solid-yellow w-full\" onclick=\"siteSelectProceed();\">\r\n        Continue\r\n      </button>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n  document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", function() {\r\n    const siteContainers = document.querySelectorAll(\".site-selection-item\");\r\n    const footerControl  = document.getElementById('footerControl');\r\n    const searchInput    = document.getElementById('search');\r\n    const regionHeaders  = document.querySelectorAll('.region-header');\r\n    const regionItems    = document.querySelectorAll('.region-items');\r\n\r\n    function resetCheckboxes() {\r\n      siteContainers.forEach(container => {\r\n        const cb  = container.querySelector(\"input[type='checkbox']\");\r\n        const img = container.querySelector(\".checkbox-img\");\r\n\r\n        if (cb && img) {\r\n          cb.checked = false;\r\n          img.src = \"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_checkbox-off.svg\";\r\n        }\r\n      });\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    siteContainers.forEach(container => {\r\n      const cb  = container.querySelector(\"input[type='checkbox']\");\r\n      const img = container.querySelector(\".checkbox-img\");\r\n\r\n      if (!cb || !img) {\r\n        return;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      container.addEventListener(\"click\", function() {\r\n        if (!cb.checked) {\r\n          resetCheckboxes();\r\n          cb.checked = true;\r\n          img.src = \"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_checkbox-on.svg\";\r\n          footerControl.classList.remove('hidden');\r\n        } else {\r\n          cb.checked = false;\r\n          img.src = \"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_checkbox-off.svg\";\r\n          footerControl.classList.add('hidden');\r\n        }\r\n      });\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    searchInput.addEventListener(\"input\", function() {\r\n      const q     = this.value.toLowerCase().trim();\r\n      const items = document.querySelectorAll('.site-selection-item');\r\n\r\n      if (q) {\r\n        regionHeaders.forEach(h => h.style.display = 'none');\r\n        regionItems.forEach(r => r.style.display = '');\r\n        items.forEach(item => {\r\n          const txt = item.querySelector('p').textContent.toLowerCase();\r\n          item.style.display = txt.includes(q) ? 'flex' : 'none';\r\n        });\r\n      } else {\r\n        regionHeaders.forEach(h => h.style.display = '');\r\n        regionItems.forEach(r => r.style.display = 'none');\r\n        items.forEach(i => i.style.display = '');\r\n      }\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.region-group').forEach(group => {\r\n      const header = group.querySelector('.region-header');\r\n      const items  = group.querySelector('.region-items');\r\n      const icon   = header.querySelector('i');\r\n\r\n      header.classList.add('closed');\r\n      items.style.display = 'none';\r\n      icon.classList.add('omni-chevron-down');\r\n      icon.classList.remove('omni-chevron-up');\r\n\r\n      header.addEventListener('click', () => {\r\n        const hidden = items.style.display === 'none';\r\n        items.style.display = hidden ? '' : 'none';\r\n        header.classList.toggle('closed', !hidden);\r\n        icon.classList.toggle('omni-chevron-up', hidden);\r\n        icon.classList.toggle('omni-chevron-down', !hidden);\r\n      });\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    const currentSiteCode = 'OMP_SUTT';\r\n\r\n    if (currentSiteCode) {\r\n      const selectedInput = document.querySelector('input[name=\"cinema_item\"][value=\"' + currentSiteCode + '\"]');\r\n\r\n      if (selectedInput) {\r\n        const container   = selectedInput.closest('.site-selection-item');\r\n        const regionGroup = container.closest('.region-group');\r\n\r\n        if (regionGroup) {\r\n          const header = regionGroup.querySelector('.region-header');\r\n          const items  = regionGroup.querySelector('.region-items');\r\n          const icon   = header.querySelector('i');\r\n\r\n          items.style.display = '';\r\n          header.classList.remove('closed');\r\n          icon.classList.add('omni-chevron-up');\r\n          icon.classList.remove('omni-chevron-down');\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        selectedInput.checked = true;\r\n\r\n        const img = container.querySelector('.checkbox-img');\r\n        if (img) {\r\n          img.src = \"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_checkbox-on.svg\";\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        footerControl.classList.remove('hidden');\r\n        container.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' });\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n        // getLatLong();\r\n      });\r\n\r\n  function siteSelectSubmit() {\r\n    document.getElementById('siteList-modal').submit();\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  function siteSelectProceed() {\r\n    document.getElementById('siteSelectButton').classList.add('disabled');\r\n    siteSelectSubmit();\r\n  }\r\n</script>  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- And here  -->\r\n\r\n<div class=\"pt-1 pb-2 relative\" style=\"overflow: visible;\">\r\n  <div style=\"\r\n    position: absolute;\r\n    top: 50%;\r\n    left: 50%;\r\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\r\n    width: 100%;\r\n    height: 90%;\r\n    background: radial-gradient(\r\n      circle at center,\r\n      #ffea00 0%,\r\n      rgba(255,234,0,0.12) 35%,\r\n      rgba(255,234,0,0) 100%\r\n    );\r\n    filter: blur(30px);\r\n    -webkit-filter: blur(30px);\r\n    z-index: 0;\">\r\n  </div>\r\n  <section id=\"showcase\" class=\"main-container-s2s splide mb-mid\" style=\"position: relative;\">\r\n    <div class=\"splide__track\">\r\n      <ul class=\"splide__list\">\r\n                  <div class=\"splide__slide showtime-card\" style=\"background-image: url('https://www.omniplexcinemas.co.uk/cms/Star Wars The Mandalorian and Grogu Web Slider.webp');\"><div class=\"showtime-card-graident\"><div class=\"showtime-card-content\"><h2 class=\"showtime-title mb-2\">Star Wars: The Mandalorian and Grogu</h2><div class=\"showtime-details flex items-center gap-3 flex-wrap justify-start\"><a href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/star-wars-the-mandalorian-and-grogu\" class=\"!mx-px btn-solid-yellow showtime-button\">Book now</a><span class=\"showtime-age-rating flex-shrink-0\"><img title=\"BBFC - 12A\" class=\"showtime-age-rating-img\" src=\"/images/ratings/UK_12A.png\" /></span><span class=\"showtime-genre\">Action, Adventure</span></div></div></div></div>                  <div class=\"splide__slide showtime-card\"