ading-tight md:leading-tight mr-4\">\r\n              <a href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/masters-of-the-universe\">\r\n                Masters Of The Universe              </a>\r\n            </p>\r\n            <img data-toggle=\"0\" id=\"favourite107143\" onClick=\"toggleFavourite('107143');return false;\" src=\"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_favourited-off.svg\" class=\"w-4 mt-2 mx-3\" alt=\"Add to Favourites\" />  \r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\">\r\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\">\r\n              <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\r\n                <img src=\"/images/ratings/UK_12A.png\" class=\"w-4\" />\r\n                <p class=\"text-base leading-snug font-normal leading-none\">Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Sci-Fi</p>\r\n              </div>\r\n              <p class=\"mb-2 md:m-auto flex item-center\"><span class=\"hidden md:flex mr-2\">|</span> 2hrs 14min </p>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n          \r\n            <p class=\"hidden md:block mb-2 pt-2\">\r\n              <span class=\"synopsis-short\">\r\n                Director Travis Knight brings the legendary franchise back to the big screen in this epic live-action adventure. After being separated for fifteen years, the Sword of Power leads Prince Adam back to Eternia where he discovers his home shattered under...              </span>\r\n\r\n                              <span class=\"synopsis-full hidden text-base\">\r\n                  Director Travis Knight brings the legendary franchise back to the big screen in this epic live-action adventure. After being separated for fifteen years, the Sword of Power leads Prince Adam back to Eternia where he discovers his home shattered under the fiendish rule of Skeletor. To save his family and his world, Adam must join forces with his closest allies, Teela and Duncan aka Man-At-Arms, and embrace his true destiny as He-Man - the most powerful man in the universe.                </span>\r\n\r\n                <button \r\n                  type=\"button\"\r\n                  class=\"ml-2 text-ompYellow underline text-base\"\r\n                  onclick=\"toggleSynopsis(this)\"\r\n                >\r\n                  See more\r\n                </button>\r\n                          </p>\r\n          <div class=\"hallTypeIcon hidden\">\r\n                                          <img src=\"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_maxx.svg\" class=\"h-4 w-auto my-2\" alt=\"Event Type Icon\" />\r\n                                                </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <!-- C -->\r\n      <div class=\"col-span-3 md:col-span-5 md:col-start-1\">\r\n        <div class=\"w-full grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 sm:col-span-2 xl:grid-cols-3  gap-2\">\r\n          <a aria-label=\"Masters Of The Universe at 13:40 in Screen 8\" href=\"https://www.omniplexcinemas.co.uk/booking/seats/sutton/42367\" class=\"\"> \r\n<div id=\"perf_0\" class=\"showTimeBox bg-ompGray-times p-2 col-span-1 rounded-xl\">\r\n  <div class=\"topSection flex justify-between items-end\">\r\n    <div class=\"flex items-end\">\r\n      <div class=\"flex items-baseline\">\r\n        <h4 class=\"bigText mr-1 leading-none\" aria-label=\"Masters Of The Universe at 13:40 in Screen 8\">\r\n          13:40        </h4>\r\n        <p class=\"smallText leading-none\" aria-label=\"Masters Of The Universe starts at 13:40 and ends at 15:54\">\r\n          - 15:54        </p>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"flex items-end\">\r\n              <div class=\"flex items-baseline\">\r\n          <p class=\"smallText mr-1 leading-none\" aria-label=\"Cost starting from &pound;8.95\">\r\n            From\r\n          </p>\r\n          <h4 class=\"bigText leading-none\" aria-label=\"Cost starting from &pound;8.95\">\r\n            &pound;8.95          </h4>\r\n        </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"