nderstand. When he is found dead, the sheep realize at once that it was a murder and think they know everything about how to go about solving it.              </span>\r\n\r\n                          </p>\r\n          <div class=\"hallTypeIcon hidden\">\r\n                                  </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <!-- C -->\r\n      <div class=\"col-span-3 md:col-span-5 md:col-start-1\">\r\n        <div class=\"w-full grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 sm:col-span-2 xl:grid-cols-3  gap-2\">\r\n          <a aria-label=\"The Sheep Detectives at 10:35 in Screen 9\" href=\"https://www.omniplexcinemas.co.uk/booking/seats/sutton/42599\" class=\"\"> \r\n<div id=\"perf_0\" class=\"showTimeBox bg-ompGray-times p-2 col-span-1 rounded-xl\">\r\n  <div class=\"topSection flex justify-between items-end\">\r\n    <div class=\"flex items-end\">\r\n      <div class=\"flex items-baseline\">\r\n        <h4 class=\"bigText mr-1 leading-none\" aria-label=\"The Sheep Detectives at 10:35 in Screen 9\">\r\n          10:35        </h4>\r\n        <p class=\"smallText leading-none\" aria-label=\"The Sheep Detectives starts at 10:35 and ends at 12:24\">\r\n          - 12:24        </p>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"flex items-end\">\r\n              <div class=\"flex items-baseline\">\r\n          <p class=\"smallText mr-1 leading-none\" aria-label=\"Cost starting from \">\r\n            From\r\n          </p>\r\n          <h4 class=\"bigText leading-none\" aria-label=\"Cost starting from \">\r\n                      </h4>\r\n        </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"midSection flex justify-between items-baseline\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"mb-2\"></div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"bottomSection flex justify-between items-baseline\">\r\n    <div class=\"flex items-baseline w-auto\">\r\n      <div class=\"flex items-start w-auto\">\r\n        <p class=\"smallText\">Screen 9</p>\r\n      </div> \r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\