ht md:leading-tight mr-4\">\r\n              <a href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/k-pop-demon-hunters-a-sing-along-event-\">\r\n                K-Pop Demon Hunters (A Sing-Along Event)              </a>\r\n            </p>\r\n            <img data-toggle=\"0\" id=\"favourite101174\" onClick=\"toggleFavourite('101174');return false;\" src=\"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_favourited-off.svg\" class=\"w-4 mt-2 mx-3\" alt=\"Add to Favourites\" />  \r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\">\r\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\">\r\n              <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\r\n                <img src=\"/images/ratings/UK_PG.png\" class=\"w-4\" />\r\n                <p class=\"text-base leading-snug font-normal leading-none\">Action, Adventure, Animation, Fantasy</p>\r\n              </div>\r\n              <p class=\"mb-2 md:m-auto flex item-center\"><span class=\"hidden md:flex mr-2\">|</span> 1hr 35min </p>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n          \r\n            <p class=\"hidden md:block mb-2 pt-2\">\r\n              <span class=\"synopsis-short\">\r\n                KPOP DEMON HUNTERS, the global smash-hit returns to cinemas for a special one-year anniversary release from June 10-18\r\n\r\nWhen they aren't selling out stadiums, K-pop superstars Rumi, Mira and Zoey use their secret identities as badass demon hunters ...              </span>\r\n\r\n                              <span class=\"synopsis-full hidden text-base\">\r\n                  KPOP DEMON HUNTERS, the global smash-hit returns to cinemas for a special one-year anniversary release from June 10-18\r\n\r\nWhen they aren't selling out stadiums, K-pop superstars Rumi, Mira and Zoey use their secret identities as badass demon hunters to protect their fans from an ever-present supernatural threat. Together, they must face their biggest enemy yet ? an irresistible rival boy band of demons in disguise.           